# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ChampisHW .gitignore — KiCad PCB project
# TRACKED:  .kicad_pcb/.kicad_pro, generar_*.py, schematic PDF,
#           the two frozen fab .zip deliverables (provenance).
# IGNORED:  regenerable loose Gerber folders, KiCad autosave/backup noise.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Regenerable Gerber output folders (produced by generar_*.py) ──
# Kept on disk, out of git — regenerate from KiCad source any time.
Gerbers_ChampIS_v3/
Gerbers_Finales/

# ── Loose Gerber/drill files if any land in root ──────────────
*.gbr
*.gbl
*.gtl
*.gbo
*.gto
*.gbs
*.gts
*.gbu
*.gm1
*.gbrjob
*.drl

# NOTE: the two frozen deliverable zips ARE tracked on purpose
# (ChampIS_v3_Gerbers_KISS.zip, ChampIS_v3_Produccion.zip) for fab
# provenance. Other build zips are ignored:
*.zip
!ChampIS_v3_Gerbers_KISS.zip
!ChampIS_v3_Produccion.zip

# ── KiCad autosave / backup / lock noise ──────────────────────
*-backups/
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak
_autosave-*
*.lck
fp-info-cache
~*.lck

# ── macOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
